WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.096 --> 00:00:03.179
(somber piano music)

00:00:09.448 --> 00:00:12.198
(crowd chatters)

00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:20.390
- I think that she's
embodied service, sacrifice,

00:00:21.840 --> 00:00:24.823
she's been an example of leadership,

00:00:29.670 --> 00:00:32.103
and she's been a constant.

00:00:33.690 --> 00:00:37.231
(somber piano music)

00:00:37.231 --> 00:00:42.231
♪ Long to reign over us ♪

00:00:43.052 --> 00:00:46.635
♪ God save the King, Queen ♪

00:00:48.807 --> 00:00:51.373
(crowd members applaud)

00:00:51.373 --> 00:00:53.010
- I think it's properly
hit us now (giggles)

00:00:53.010 --> 00:00:54.900
with us singing the anthem and everything,

00:00:54.900 --> 00:00:55.733
we're just like, you can't really

00:00:55.733 --> 00:00:57.203
hold the emotions back anymore.

00:01:03.754 --> 00:01:06.837
♪ God save the Queen ♪

00:01:09.888 --> 00:01:12.032
(crowd members applaud)

00:01:12.032 --> 00:01:15.115
(somber piano music)

00:01:28.724 --> 00:01:31.860
- Through thick and
thin, Queen Elizabeth II

00:01:31.860 --> 00:01:34.080
provided us with the stability

00:01:34.080 --> 00:01:36.720
and the strength that we needed.

00:01:36.720 --> 00:01:39.810
She was the very spirit of Great Britain,

00:01:39.810 --> 00:01:41.643
and that spirit will endure.

00:01:42.561 --> 00:01:45.644
(somber piano music)

00:02:05.771 --> 00:02:08.730
- We mourn for all of you.

00:02:08.730 --> 00:02:09.780
She was a great lady.

00:02:11.250 --> 00:02:13.890
We're so delighted we got to meet her.

00:02:13.890 --> 00:02:17.490
- Queen Elizabeth II is
the only reigning monarch

00:02:17.490 --> 00:02:19.440
most of us have known,

00:02:19.440 --> 00:02:23.130
and the only one to ever visit Australia.

00:02:23.130 --> 00:02:28.000
- In a complicated world, her steady grace

00:02:30.270 --> 00:02:35.270
and resolve brought comfort
and strength to us all.

00:02:36.018 --> 00:02:39.101
(somber piano music)

